Subject: [PATCH] fix(ci): pass lint and tests on the patched tree

Upstream 0.3.0 added an unnecessary clone and several stale tests, and the polling patches had six clippy errors. Allow the wide polling helpers, collapse the rate-limit branch, avoid the slice clone, and update the chat, OAuth consent, API token, and project retry tests to the current shapes.
